# Dotenv files hold live credentials (Postgres/Neon URLs with passwords) and
# must never be committed. Match the whole family, not just bare ".env":
# .env.neon was tracked on this branch until it was caught and untracked.
# A leading space made the five entries above silently no-op patterns, so
# ".env.neon" slipped through; these are anchored with no indentation.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
